{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "35fd6860-0bed-88fe-86bf-0cc515d902bb",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T13:52:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice Tillinghast",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:49:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:49:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. This is Janice Tillinghast. I'm calling about an old appliance, basically a chest freezer that quit on me, and I need to know how to get it hauled off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:49:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Are you putting it out at the curb, or do you need someone to come get it from inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:49:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Basically it's on my back porch right now. It's been sitting there since before the holidays. I can't lift it, obviously, so I'd need somebody to take it. Is that a bulky pickup, or what is it, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:49:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appliances usually go through a bulky item pickup, and freezers can have extra rules because of the refrigerant. They have to be handled a certain way. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:50:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 62 Van Zandt Avenue, up in the North End. I'm the renter, the landlord's not much help with this kind of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:50:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 62 Van Zandt. Does the freezer still have the door on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:50:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the door's on. I took everything out of it, defrosted it, the whole bit. After that storm last weekend, the snow turning to rain Sunday into Monday, the porch got wet, so it's sitting in a puddle, basically. I'd like it gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:50:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Let me see what the schedule looks like for a pickup in your area. Can you hold for just a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:50:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:50:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for holding. So the thing is, a freezer has to be tagged after the refrigerant is dealt with, and I don't have a firm date for you on my screen. Someone in the office would have to set that up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:50:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Well, basically I'd like a supervisor to call me back about it. I called once in the fall about it and nobody got back to me, so I'd like somebody with a little authority to ring me directly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:51:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. I can put in a request for a supervisor to call you. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:51:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0181. That's my landline, so if I don't pick up right away, I'm probably in the other room. Just let it ring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:51:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0181. I'm sorry, you're really close to the phone, I'm hearing a bit of popping on the p's. Could you say the street one more time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:51:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry. Is that better? Sixty-two Van Zandt Avenue. Van Zandt, V-A-N, then Z-A-N-D-T."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:51:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, that came through clear. So I have a freezer on the back porch at 62 Van Zandt Avenue, you're asking for a supervisor to call about pickup. I'll note that the door is on and it's emptied."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:51:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. And basically, should I leave it where it is until they call, or move it to the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:51:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd leave it where it is until you hear from them. They'll tell you where it needs to go and when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:51:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. When might I expect that call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:52:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually within a day or two. If it's tomorrow afternoon or Thursday, don't be surprised."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:52:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Tillinghast. Take care."
    }
  ],
